<title>UK: April consumer coffee stocks up 1.1 mln bags - Man.</title>
<headline>April consumer coffee stocks up 1.1 mln bags - Man.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>World consumer coffee stocks stood at 10 million bags in April, up from 8.80 million in March and 1.1 million bags higher than in April 1996, UK trade house E D &amp; F Man said on Friday.</p>
<p>Stocks were now 2.4 million bags above the all-time-low of December 1996, reflecting some of the impact of high coffee imports earlier this year, Man said in its April/May coffee report.</p>
